# Pairs with ReplacedRootRelocated (issue #5819). A root seed that does not
# re-check under the gate replaces the loaded root after the publish.
MODULE: ReplacedRootRelocatedSeedAfterPublish
TARGET: ReplacedRootRelocated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a batch write seeds a root after the load has published, overwriting the loaded root
PERTURBS: BatchMidLoad
BOUNDS: NeverWritten = 1

--- FIND
    /\ WithSkip
    /\ ~oUp
    /\ ~published
    /\ phase \in {"begun", "created", "retry"}
--- REPLACE
    /\ WithSkip
    /\ ~oUp
\* MUTATION: the root seed does not see the published root (issue #5819).
    /\ phase \in {"begun", "created", "retry", "finished"}
--- END
